"List automation workflows — see what automatic actions are configured (auto-"
"assign, auto-tag, auto-reply, etc.) and their triggers. Helps you understand "
"what the system handles automatically so you don't duplicate work. Paginated;"
" use page/per_page to navigate. Requires Fluent Support Pro."
